## Refresh policy

NEVER edit files under `playwright-core/`. A refresh is a re-copy from a new
upstream commit, followed by regenerating
`src/server/__tests__/vendor-hashes.json` (the integrity test hashes the
directory and fails on any drift). Adaptation happens in `relay-instance.ts`
via subclass/wrapper only — see design add-browser-relay D2.
